{"item": "cv04", "show": "dbza", "youtube": "hAfONEwrrsE", "title": "Cell Vs Sonic & Knuckles", "duration": 139, "lines": [{"i": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 8.62, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "*Humming - Escape from the City*"}, {"i": 1, "start": 8.62, "end": 9.98, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "What in the blue blazes?"}, {"i": 2, "start": 12.46, "end": 13.18, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Sonic", "text": "Hey There!"}, {"i": 3, "start": 13.18, "end": 16.44, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Sonic", "text": "Sonic the Hedgehog's my name, speed's my game!"}, {"i": 4, "start": 17.52, "end": 19.7, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Knuckles", "text": "And I'm the Echidna, Knuckles."}, {"i": 5, "start": 20.26, "end": 21.52, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "Say his name and he shall..."}, {"i": 6, "start": 21.52, "end": 24.2, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Knuckles", "text": "And unlike him, I don't Chuckle."}, {"i": 7, "start": 24.2, "end": 24.96, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "Ha!"}, {"i": 8, "start": 24.96, "end": 27.36, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Sonic", "text": "Now, ya big bad BeetleBorg,"}, {"i": 9, "start": 27.36, "end": 31.24, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Sonic", "text": "we'll give you one chance to high-tail it before we have to take you down!"}, {"i": 10, "start": 31.24, "end": 31.9, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Knuckles", "text": "Yeah!"}, {"i": 11, "start": 31.9, "end": 34.3, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Knuckles", "text": "Either cut the crap, or we'll beat it out of ya!"}, {"i": 12, "start": 34.3, "end": 36.66, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "Really? What's the hedgehog gonna do?"}, {"i": 13, "start": 36.66, "end": 37.66, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "Give me Rabies?"}, {"i": 14, "start": 37.66, "end": 40.22, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Sonic", "text": "I challenge you to a race, Cell!"}, {"i": 15, "start": 40.22, "end": 44.82, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Sonic", "text": "If you lose, then you gotta leave the planet, and NEVER come back!"}, {"i": 16, "start": 44.82, "end": 47.04, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "Ah, a test of speed, then..."}, {"i": 17, "start": 47.66, "end": 48.28, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Sonic", "text": "Ah!"}, {"i": 18, "start": 48.28, "end": 52.6, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Sonic", "text": "[clone] CELL: Don't mind me, I'm just occupying multiple spaces at once."}, {"i": 19, "start": 52.6, "end": 53.98, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Sonic", "text": "H-how are you-"}, {"i": 20, "start": 53.98, "end": 55.98, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "With MY speed."}, {"i": 21, "start": 55.98, "end": 58.3, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "There's also a third one selling chilli dogs outside the ring."}, {"i": 22, "start": 58.3, "end": 60.06, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Sonic", "text": "That's impossible."}, {"i": 23, "start": 60.06, "end": 63.4, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Sassy", "text": "CELL: No, you're too slow."}, {"i": 24, "start": 63.4, "end": 68.2, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Sassy", "text": "CELL: What's impossible is how anyone could mistake THAT thing for an echidna."}, {"i": 25, "start": 68.2, "end": 72.72, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Knuckles", "text": "Oh, I am gonna stomp a mudhole in your ass and walk it dry now-"}, {"i": 26, "start": 75.64, "end": 76.24, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Knuckles", "text": "Ow..."}, {"i": 27, "start": 76.24, "end": 77.86, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Sonic", "text": "Knuckles!"}, {"i": 28, "start": 77.86, "end": 79.82, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Sonic", "text": "I have no choice now..."}, {"i": 29, "start": 79.82, "end": 82.48, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Sonic", "text": "I'll have to use... the EMERALDS!"}, {"i": 30, "start": 82.48, "end": 83.94, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "(chuckles)"}, {"i": 31, "start": 83.94, "end": 85.98, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "You mean the Chaos Emeralds?"}, {"i": 32, "start": 86.7, "end": 89.1, "kind": "sfx", "speaker": null, "text": "slow motion evil laugh"}, {"i": 33, "start": 89.32, "end": 94.6, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Sonic", "text": "*stammering in disbelief*"}, {"i": 34, "start": 95.7, "end": 98.04, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Knuckles", "text": "Wait, hold on! You're my ride!"}, {"i": 35, "start": 98.04, "end": 99.9, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Knuckles", "text": "Aww, man!"}, {"i": 36, "start": 99.9, "end": 100.84, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "nervous giggling"}, {"i": 37, "start": 100.84, "end": 103.0, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Knuckles", "text": "Sorry, I'm, uh... not as... fast as him."}, {"i": 38, "start": 103.0, "end": 104.2, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Knuckles", "text": "KNUCKLES (quietly): Uh, hang on."}, {"i": 39, "start": 104.8, "end": 105.3, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Knuckles", "text": "Huah!"}, {"i": 40, "start": 107.8, "end": 108.3, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Knuckles", "text": "Hu!"}, {"i": 41, "start": 108.8, "end": 110.3, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Knuckles", "text": "Gah! I... I really --"}, {"i": 42, "start": 110.7, "end": 111.3, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Knuckles", "text": "D'oh!"}, {"i": 43, "start": 111.48, "end": 113.04, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Knuckles", "text": "--wish I could do more than glide!"}, {"i": 44, "start": 114.24, "end": 117.82, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "Kids, there's nothing cooler than being hugged by someone you like."}, {"i": 45, "start": 119.58, "end": 138.88, "kind": "direction", "speaker": null, "text": "Song: Super Sonic Racing (instrumental)"}], "segments": []}